    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harvest Hunt is a single player, first-person survival horror game with a blend of rogue-lite elements, where every run is asking you to adapt in different ways in order to survive. Experience a dark folk-horror tale of a cursed village set in a suffocating atmosphere filled with dread, within the beautifully painterly rendered village of Luna Nova.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/14da645f23554aa8892259556ea74bf1.webp?t=1732706737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/577b01a16d65dae9824eb7bfaf8e9994.poster.avif?t=1732706737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/577b01a16d65dae9824eb7bfaf8e9994.webm?t=1732706737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Ambrosia, the precious resource scattered around the cornfields, grows in strange ways and the hunger for it is strong. During the night, enter the cursed land of Luna Nova and harvest Ambrosia to keep your village alive. But beware, the Devourer is prowling the fields and is tainting it. In a race against the clock, turn off your lantern to sneak and hide, or fight and banish the Devourer for a bigger reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/a50326fefb9ada026ec1e8bef67fd5e7.webp?t=1732706737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/c09d2b9e93ca15f50bbfb5cd19866c60.poster.avif?t=1732706737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/c09d2b9e93ca15f50bbfb5cd19866c60.webm?t=1732706737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Tentacle creatures, poisoned waters and other dangerous calamities plague Luna Nova. But there is still hope. During the day, experience the enigmatic Whispers, a tarot-inspired system providing endless permutations of calamities but also blessings. Play multiple tense 10-15 minute runs over the course of 5 challenging harvest seasons where your abilities reset with each season and the Devourer evolves and grows stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/017d9f6f1314ff5d1e2845185cf86244.webp?t=1732706737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/ccb833a08e5b9831d44eed8a912cf652.poster.avif?t=1732706737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/ccb833a08e5b9831d44eed8a912cf652.webm?t=1732706737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>A pricey voodoo doll made of wood or a free rusty pitchfork? An ability to build hideouts in the fields or to heal you while crouched? Unlock a myriad of otherworldly weapons and abilities for your Warden and village and build your own deck to suit your needs. Will you sacrifice your own health to equip them? Choose your playstyle and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/0bbd5eb425f051b348ee694509260b83.webp?t=1732706737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/270733ebaa2b3cf9ddfca7a3a72c6ad6.poster.avif?t=1732706737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/270733ebaa2b3cf9ddfca7a3a72c6ad6.webm?t=1732706737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>An aristocrat far removed from wealth and ease, a priest left armed with his sacred verses; what led them here, and why do these ethereal Whispers haunt their every step? Embody a colorful cast of characters and explore the lives of these seemingly ordinary villagers through the eyes of a modern day Investigator plagued with the same curse and running out of time\u2026</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harvest Hunt is a single player, first-person survival horror game with a blend of rogue-lite elements, where every run is asking you to adapt in different ways in order to survive. Experience a dark folk-horror tale of a cursed village set in a suffocating atmosphere filled with dread, within the beautifully painterly rendered village of Luna Nova.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/14da645f23554aa8892259556ea74bf1.webp?t=1732706737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/577b01a16d65dae9824eb7bfaf8e9994.poster.avif?t=1732706737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/577b01a16d65dae9824eb7bfaf8e9994.webm?t=1732706737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Ambrosia, the precious resource scattered around the cornfields, grows in strange ways and the hunger for it is strong. During the night, enter the cursed land of Luna Nova and harvest Ambrosia to keep your village alive. But beware, the Devourer is prowling the fields and is tainting it. In a race against the clock, turn off your lantern to sneak and hide, or fight and banish the Devourer for a bigger reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/a50326fefb9ada026ec1e8bef67fd5e7.webp?t=1732706737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/c09d2b9e93ca15f50bbfb5cd19866c60.poster.avif?t=1732706737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/c09d2b9e93ca15f50bbfb5cd19866c60.webm?t=1732706737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Tentacle creatures, poisoned waters and other dangerous calamities plague Luna Nova. But there is still hope. During the day, experience the enigmatic Whispers, a tarot-inspired system providing endless permutations of calamities but also blessings. Play multiple tense 10-15 minute runs over the course of 5 challenging harvest seasons where your abilities reset with each season and the Devourer evolves and grows stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/017d9f6f1314ff5d1e2845185cf86244.webp?t=1732706737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/ccb833a08e5b9831d44eed8a912cf652.poster.avif?t=1732706737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/ccb833a08e5b9831d44eed8a912cf652.webm?t=1732706737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>A pricey voodoo doll made of wood or a free rusty pitchfork? An ability to build hideouts in the fields or to heal you while crouched? Unlock a myriad of otherworldly weapons and abilities for your Warden and village and build your own deck to suit your needs. Will you sacrifice your own health to equip them? Choose your playstyle and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/0bbd5eb425f051b348ee694509260b83.webp?t=1732706737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/270733ebaa2b3cf9ddfca7a3a72c6ad6.poster.avif?t=1732706737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009620/extras/270733ebaa2b3cf9ddfca7a3a72c6ad6.webm?t=1732706737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>An aristocrat far removed from wealth and ease, a priest left armed with his sacred verses; what led them here, and why do these ethereal Whispers haunt their every step? Embody a colorful cast of characters and explore the lives of these seemingly ordinary villagers through the eyes of a modern day Investigator plagued with the same curse and running out of time\u2026</p>",
    "short_description": "You are the Warden. Enter the dense cornfields and gather the resources your village desperately needs. But beware: you are not alone. Build a deck of abilities and choose your weapons to face the growing dangers of the night. With a relentless monster after you, will you make it out alive?",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cWe got to check out this first-person survival horror game early and to be honest, we haven\u2019t slept since.\u201d<br>Overclockers<br><br>\u201c...Harvest Hunt is an exceptional horror game. Its chilling sound design, graphic novel-inspired visuals, and the ingeniously crafted premise of a hunt-or-be-hunted dynamic are brilliantly brought to life, making it a fantastic entry in the horror game genre.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Gamerheads Pod<br><br>\u201cHarvest Hunt is packed with old European folklore, the kind people used to tell their kids to keep them from running off alone into the woods\u201d<br>PCGamesN<br>",
